{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "1_4_002_08",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:2d6ef78177ee9491c50846307bd95393888dd4e7e64de98ddbf62cbb4a0bab31",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_08:1_4_002_08_a:cmd-000000:title:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:3aab900f87083af6090ac47214011cd8a1d82ffb4eacbe60c1790dbf58616830",
      "text": "厄运也是幸运！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_08:1_4_002_08_a:cmd-000000:synopsis:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:3ba886fc2f5a625f776ea6d3c65ddf89cee4fa900d14252193e93bb16944f816",
      "text": "FRAME决定出战男极“力量部门”。\n在Cafe Parade的慰劳品支持下，\n他们挺过了诚司的特训，终于迎来了正式演出的\n舞台，然而在前往会场的途中，\n被告知的消息却是……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_08:1_4_002_08_a:cmd-000038:title:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:80e498f00eddab0e29051b175768d604c18ab0086fada3bff7c892660c85b4f1",
      "text": "第8话",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_08:1_4_002_08_a:cmd-000038:title:001": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:3aab900f87083af6090ac47214011cd8a1d82ffb4eacbe60c1790dbf58616830",
      "text": "厄运也是幸运！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_08:1_4_002_08_a:cmd-000058:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a49eed001defc7aff1a5242ec72a72f0c68fd3abfa8a50593a213d2ba44b8ec9",
      "text": "今天的特训到此为止！解散！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_08:1_4_002_08_a:cmd-000074:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b576f1ced2cf9e8e206f4a4ba365e263bc7f6b6137efc0191dec7a32d35f1d27",
      "text": "谢谢……指导……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_08:1_4_002_08_a:cmd-000100:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c11e637b7f7001b4181ddca31c06015cffb34b95739bb3d10b8ae42c6d5eb5de",
      "text": "照这个状态下去，当天在“力量部门”里，\n说不定能连续唱上3个小时呢！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_08:1_4_002_08_a:cmd-000110:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:affd1c87376fc361d6958d1000db21b51d26a027dac0c7c22308fd93a74d1883",
      "text": "哈、哈哈……啊，是啊。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_08:1_4_002_08_a:cmd-000121:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:27daf12ead3afc485bd695fc41aceb6686f18b831a28dac5e641411df7c5d707",
      "text": "作为我们的对手登上舞台的，\n是来自全国各地自夸力气大的偶像们。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_08:1_4_002_08_a:cmd-000129:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:da926b2d7e3b0ff81ab778056ed4576a84d088ae0dcd424c0415f0113b3db992",
      "text": "为了能在他们当中拔得头筹，\n必须比平时练出更多的力量才行。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_08:1_4_002_08_a:cmd-000137:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e54b74f419daaa42b1cb0387479fb3471c5c0403c8c6b48523379b79a3bbe7d1",
      "text": "自从开始接受诚司先生的斯巴达特训，\n感觉体力确实比以前好了不少……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_08:1_4_002_08_a:cmd-000146:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:9c6e43bc6ed829fe9607b3e7c40822673759737e8c392e1a29b24783b0a4d735",
      "text": "这样下去的话，拿第一也不是梦！\n当然，还有315 Pro的目标——男极KING也是……！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_08:1_4_002_08_a:cmd-000162:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:60ce2463a3ffc982484e66e3e0d61d489ca356b6adb3d076374103b5a9ea6c1f",
      "text": "呜呜，肚子饿瘪了～。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_08:1_4_002_08_a:cmd-000167:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ec24454ccc165116b3fa36d7e976578d7d7d677d588af0432c28889e494e0e83",
      "text": "今天也是从早到晚\n排得满满当当的课程呢。我也饿扁了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_08:1_4_002_08_a:cmd-000189:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:8343a186b3f9a1c505cec7b478a7ee70a463ee71743d42ffa1f8310276488f65",
      "text": "FRAME的各位！\n训练辛苦了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_08:1_4_002_08_b:cmd-000057:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a2a31973cdad38938c265ed64efc1f7c907f9b73bc06c5a6d40a38409823daf8",
      "text": "卷绪。还有Cafe Parade的大家。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_08:1_4_002_08_b:cmd-000083:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:329bf50cbb0bf598dbcfb6583e16853eefae0ad66bdea95e5165b66e7fd4139a",
      "text": "晚上好，训练辛苦了。\n我们带了慰劳品过来，不嫌弃的话请用吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_08:1_4_002_08_b:cmd-000094:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:1a608ff787a82a7b384ceb76be9dd5b962acb872416848eae5ed78d5e9eaa71f",
      "text": "哎！可以吗？\n一直以来太感谢你们了！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_08:1_4_002_08_b:cmd-000107:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:dfaa617abadb8eee7b267a513efcd3aac94d8c20465f9a8aea1cf42353f8b8df",
      "text": "当然。\n今天的推荐是阿斯兰特制的炸鱿鱼哦。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_08:1_4_002_08_b:cmd-000131:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:5324468f088f19da6a11ed0303b140b4757ddcaaf276f934e1a1807ed2def38f",
      "text": "今天的看起来也很香啊。\n哦，这边的盒子里是甜品吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_08:1_4_002_08_b:cmd-000138:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:49541057fc7077db683bd33cd3cdcccd7b3e649ddb3f092dc284ea0659ee216d",
      "text": "是的。这是特制水果蛋糕。\n水果对恢复疲劳也是很有效果的。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_08:1_4_002_08_b:cmd-000149:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:57dd20003777655f20b7455d48472dc7cb812d61c4c9644651bc0300260ab247",
      "text": "太感谢了！不过……\n有慰劳品固然高兴，每次都这么准备不辛苦吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_08:1_4_002_08_b:cmd-000174:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:fe2718c00da318b28c6cdcf0d5a42dca18fc4e015a910fcd25ae958114e9c3bb",
      "text": "否。汝等亦是吾等难得的同胞。\n此乃分内之事！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_08:1_4_002_08_b:cmd-000182:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:43cfb559969fcc6e9757dab82794ff610cb31939890cdf5e51a7598d86de52b4",
      "text": "阿斯兰啊，因为你们三个人吃得特别香，\n每次做的时候看起来都很开心呢♪",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_08:1_4_002_08_b:cmd-000190:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d5011a7ecb865298199ba7d716e5f5258f210faf3a51631e464aa64374b298a4",
      "text": "对了，大家有什么忌口吗？\n想当下一次慰劳品的参考，告诉我嘛！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_08:1_4_002_08_b:cmd-000217:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6d6a7dff77e5f4cd570f1758f98d105f6caa1a0ce01d91ca4556bdab9ecc125c",
      "text": "哈哈，没事，我什么都吃。\n谢谢你这么替我们考虑！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_08:1_4_002_08_b:cmd-000222:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:290a08a348486f9a91149367cd5f9e276d0108831c2be520fd97023888204e80",
      "text": "我、我也没什么挑剔的，没关系！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_08:1_4_002_08_b:cmd-000238:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:66c97196e02f30083c4dcd20526a4fc7f2331bf94171df948e71243bed7e169b",
      "text": "当着这俩人的面，虽然有点不好意思开口……\n我不大擅长吃青椒。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_08:1_4_002_08_b:cmd-000265:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:3a27d8e6421cb1d6131d2d08f75daab222360be46676bb22c10605447a4a4124",
      "text": "嗯嗯……谢谢告知。\n我们会作为下次菜单的参考的！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_08:1_4_002_08_c:cmd-000021:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6fb512a54279d51dca428e90d690e09db5bfeec4e1720dd5f175a852419d2b6e",
      "text": "数日后……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_08:1_4_002_08_c:cmd-000038:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:5164f2f3085f40a3c32c08e8edb2b746a8f5dd73d3437ce4c63558ba90a7471f",
      "text": "保险起见先点个名哦。\n英雄先生、龙先生、诚司先生！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_08:1_4_002_08_c:cmd-000049:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b5b20dbf03c04583c34840757f14deaaf5b7b782796ba7738947d3d5e6d6cf8f",
      "text": "噢！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_08:1_4_002_08_c:cmd-000055:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a4d0a6f353601ccf9576f8dbfcc3575fa9e10dedf3651529b25e38fbf92430b9",
      "text": "FRAME，全员到齐呢。\n那我去向工作人员汇报一下！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_08:1_4_002_08_c:cmd-000063:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:1cb0ccc804e30335d1c1f224c489bb07f4b67907f3ad59708a8c3543b87175a7",
      "text": "终于明天就是正式演出了。\n发挥特训成果的时刻到了！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_08:1_4_002_08_c:cmd-000074:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:44ae9293063263218d15d8d7ccec28d20a7769be3e94b9757653a093013decd4",
      "text": "是啊。……话说回来，这辆大巴。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_08:1_4_002_08_c:cmd-000084:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:bcb26dc015627f4ccab26bb2fa59f3e82feb58feaf05e0c9d4ef199fc0b4d1f9",
      "text": "乘客全都是肌肉男，很有威慑感啊……\n真不愧是男极“力量部门”的参赛者们。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_08:1_4_002_08_c:cmd-000096:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:425ddd91db870bbe9e8ecf0c434d3617d23b91b88e8aad283d019acdf98bcd4d",
      "text": "呜呜。终于等到能从诚司先生的\n斯巴达特训中解放出来的这一天了……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_08:1_4_002_08_c:cmd-000107:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:15d87c9161df5162639759b614faed990ab16a33f66aa89606a0d9a20b3e9186",
      "text": "虽然每天都累到瘫软，\n但明天一定要帅气地大显身手！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_08:1_4_002_08_c:cmd-000121:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:1b3e68caed061a7581c5d1bddf035f84f49f7f018a97f5d42bf885cd6e66b3ef",
      "text": "……嗯？\n工作人员好像有点慌慌张张的……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_08:1_4_002_08_c:cmd-000135:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:5f9cc14e69f7099c03e032681346decdaa149a6db8c222f33315a60bea89af07",
      "text": "各位，非常抱歉！\n刚才接到了其他工作人员的联络……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_08:1_4_002_08_c:cmd-000144:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d5c17ca8bce1f9fc91449c0d07dd1b296911dd66bdb46e5417751a4c75fdba5c",
      "text": "出现了失误，服装和道具没能送到现场，\n舞台也依然处于未完工的状态。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_08:1_4_002_08_c:cmd-000161:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:422046b11ce8ed134f94c268082d611a783a11b0d2b271e6492082353510b059",
      "text": "男极“力量部门”将予以取消。\n后续详情，稍后会有进一步通知……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_08:1_4_002_08_d:cmd-000019:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:62ff1d835a4bae6810a6e0d424d4c54e33e8722a5c905f3f6d7bae9a2678ce91",
      "text": "怎么会……这种时候取消！？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_08:1_4_002_08_d:cmd-000021:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:1f68b2e6d52a8d911c0cc05cfddbe95522170857a3b16e98b2a0fd32c666dad1",
      "text": "大家都努力到今天了，为什么会这样……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_08:1_4_002_08_d:cmd-000033:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:0283ea83cb077a2975004b5ca20222ba039515006575a2fc528775d34cfe97d2",
      "text": "……大家都大受打击啊。这也难怪。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_08:1_4_002_08_d:cmd-000040:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c8b666b3b4e3d9f9ff06677e99a4dd683f52f3b2079a99a03cc8a1611e2c4288",
      "text": "我们参赛选手固然难受……\n粉丝们也一定会很失望吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_08:1_4_002_08_d:cmd-000062:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:538fdcc6645ebae7119dcb19a6bef3727ab3f7ff89416b863e2739aa07bea255",
      "text": "……喂，各位！这样办如何？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_08:1_4_002_08_d:cmd-000067:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:473972cb012568c2d5f63306a30e4140825c54d7b40fb00ef33e89c1f1284c7f",
      "text": "虽然这次的“力量部门”取消了，\n但为了直到今天都在刻苦训练的我们自己。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_08:1_4_002_08_d:cmd-000072:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:81ef269dddf2f5a15b276add955ce12cf4de69a95062ce835b47e6eb0f28545e",
      "text": "最重要的是，为了期待着明天的粉丝们。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_08:1_4_002_08_d:cmd-000078:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:27a59c90dd46d9215f0733161d56e37efb55f24ea13424253b69aaae957de95d",
      "text": "先不管男极联赛，\n由我们自己来举办舞台表演怎么样？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_08:1_4_002_08_d:cmd-000082:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:53cd822fa3442f9302fa3c229d6f16993442334a17de87f5c52b9cc9b07a0583",
      "text": "虽说没有服装和道具，但没问题。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_08:1_4_002_08_d:cmd-000090:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:478d3680413882241d2240e67d5d52319941f76f97408d9c257df76163bd5990",
      "text": "在场的每个人，都有锻炼出来的体魄。\n穿彩排用的训练服就足够了！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_08:1_4_002_08_d:cmd-000114:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:095cb0abb9aa4ef82cea7ddcba8a7c49d8fd8dcc91e8405d880baf1e5a5379fb",
      "text": "没错，就算舞台没完工，\n唱歌跳舞还是做得到的……！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_08:1_4_002_08_d:cmd-000129:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ad56ce5e42f5f6f3f3888d565cfdb2192deef3d852e212e07c847e7652e5fce4",
      "text": "……说不定总会有办法的。\n工作人员，能不能就这么走一步看一步试试？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_08:1_4_002_08_d:cmd-000136:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:3a20e8ec92f575334ce51ee9219d2ffd45b4e81f0202b1d2079b0e7123a4d580",
      "text": "我们能坚持努力到今天，\n就是为了能看到粉丝们的笑容啊。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_08:1_4_002_08_d:cmd-000143:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:0ebd8fa4b1d0b7ecf7487e18337ce399b66675f029187afc710349e48453414d",
      "text": "嗯。就算拿不到“力量部门”的第一名，\n至少也要带着粉丝们的笑容回去。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_08:1_4_002_08_d:cmd-000152:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:8b92aefc227eaf02cbe0ae74a8ce99ef78678eb56c147d989505eafba1de3f3f",
      "text": "……说得对。\n我们也想看粉丝们的笑容！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_08:1_4_002_08_d:cmd-000154:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d8d712724a2e0ed6fbb4c5470019398b47e0f4eac95c15d32d27c6ac3991ce1a",
      "text": "没错！看不到粉丝的笑容，\n这身练到现在的力气都没地方使了！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_08:1_4_002_08_d:cmd-000169:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2ec146703cd6d5370260b0ba55a4f52ee7598ea94bdf4205ebfae5ee0c4632d7",
      "text": "各位……我们也不想\n就这么草草收场，心情是一样的。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_08:1_4_002_08_d:cmd-000179:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:619168d085d5bc878e64539f3a9a7133402a81e83cd65da47310867437b4d9a1",
      "text": "就算脱离男极，\n我们也会去确认一下能不能想办法把舞台办起来！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_08:1_4_002_08_e:cmd-000018:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:48f79cfeef59fc46a374aeb0c5cd026c0a56dcaedba273fa2fb34055e9ef9549",
      "text": "舞台搭建中",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_08:1_4_002_08_e:cmd-000025:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7c85cbeb5b53e4e05fa74098a998cc7472df6a56ca6740c96977c83799d24a8b",
      "text": "喂，这个仓库里有好多能派上用场的东西！\n这样的话，搞不好行得通啊？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_08:1_4_002_08_e:cmd-000029:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c9145e5af5942b6ce2bc56349b8ec5ade40296cf4a072dd102ba281d4186c771",
      "text": "事发突然，工作人员也很不容易吧。\n能不能让我们偶像也多帮点忙？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_08:1_4_002_08_e:cmd-000036:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:34117b8aabc195cec0589770db545628f021b1ee932d887ead119c37b47c072b",
      "text": "幸好，就算只办演出\n也总算能办成了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_08:1_4_002_08_e:cmd-000042:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:48349add3783b7bb7d995e353c0413d7ac516d108ac04b602673f7864576a447",
      "text": "虽然比原计划多了不少手工打造的感觉就是了？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_08:1_4_002_08_e:cmd-000051:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:99529288a8e165e67e6faf39017daf121354c66afd8dcee75edae4ee11d6c30e",
      "text": "是啊。感觉会变成一个凝聚着大家对粉丝的心意、\n充满温暖的舞台呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_08:1_4_002_08_e:cmd-000071:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:87d5a0352b9709aff30d22941855ad4cb8a7ca6ae4ccc06e02ab9b976121735b",
      "text": "……这个全新的舞台，\n是不是起个名字比较好？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_08:1_4_002_08_e:cmd-000081:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a55a0690a7b5421dae9044c7bf9340969e784234503abfee547bd89498fe0e5e",
      "text": "也是啊……\n那，把男极“力量部门”改成……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_08:1_4_002_08_e:cmd-000091:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:45e9803cc4b88064b3944e0d0aff19fd50516d5411af85fbc877910f4f233057",
      "text": "叫“力量微笑LIVE”怎么样？\n看着在场大家的脸孔，不知不觉就想到了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_08:1_4_002_08_e:cmd-000099:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b660f657d7a32c1c336da32ab315834533814b4918a730e0e541fdc23024d4b7",
      "text": "每个人脸上都挂着\n绝不会轻易气馁的笑容，对吧？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_08:1_4_002_08_e:cmd-000105:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:3cf5924de996a01b1885d0d525d62b46118b0a333f81e48fe29d8181d3d78c9f",
      "text": "太棒了……！我赞成！\n其他人觉得如何？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_08:1_4_002_08_e:cmd-000111:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:bb3ac58a7d5f83ac55113b683fcdf99764e1bb712818307ee8c99214ec8ab6d2",
      "text": "好啊，我们也觉得很不错！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_08:1_4_002_08_e:cmd-000144:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:4fd515b83b5c3a76580f82bae2e2bbc16b352a626a25fdd5b8b97c5f85c6a19e",
      "text": "你们两位，不得了了！那边有个偶像，\n一口气搬了12把折叠椅！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_08:1_4_002_08_e:cmd-000155:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:064f8c921b4a44e9aede687e8df384e6fc8f47796a02816e460787b6a08e8b9b",
      "text": "什么！？太厉害了吧……\n还有，感觉莫名有点不甘心啊……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_08:1_4_002_08_e:cmd-000167:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:0e344ce9ae07e90003f6859c889ff9148f6457b045ab3e24145823276d498c93",
      "text": "我们一只手拿7把的话也能赢。\n对吧，龙？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_08:1_4_002_08_e:cmd-000173:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b8175773738a7f303c2c47ea49ce9350df207981da2c15b6aa95838174231782",
      "text": "是！只要用上手指的力量，还能拿更多……！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_08:1_4_002_08_e:cmd-000191:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b31589e3ad2c3e76aabb62795d1d90b626c60d5ee9ddb6139094cfc394712b2d",
      "text": "你们俩比以前更靠得住了啊！\n好。去比比看谁才是第一吧！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_08:1_4_002_08_e:cmd-000204:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d754b865bcb97c6ac4d1751a7324118e65611b0ee124791cbf4f7dff6d44926c",
      "text": "数小时后……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_08:1_4_002_08_e:cmd-000223:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:692c0ec50401d10e7cb40d6563ea44a79396ad4d88b4ca1999cbecbc4927589b",
      "text": "各位，辛苦了！\n这是Cafe Parade送来的特制便当慰劳品哦。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_08:1_4_002_08_e:cmd-000233:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c51a141e1c73eb5822c2c592ebd44d5c2d4c488a0ac202ffe7bb7688232ad2da",
      "text": "谢谢。\n哈哈，把我不擅长吃的青椒给去掉了啊。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_08:1_4_002_08_e:cmd-000247:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:aba9ca6b6569fc2120ec31688f26b1ef9e9d040d8b11b890e650ccc5e4d93c3e",
      "text": "哎？我讨厌吃的鱿鱼也没有放！\n明明没跟他们说过啊，怎么回事？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_08:1_4_002_08_e:cmd-000252:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ea630243b166db9ed9d794104a64988fe5a5e0664bc508ecc10da5919fe66b9e",
      "text": "其实……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_08:1_4_002_08_f:cmd-000018:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:3081715a7ab3f7550973d10f6272f5a1a5f7de18c4e4300a531631f1e3d704e0",
      "text": "数日前……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_08:1_4_002_08_f:cmd-000034:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:1204cf5561b7d25f79f59266c765eac0d3ca41624cd6e44ae51be4ba381511fd",
      "text": "下次做什么菜单好呢？\n为了能补充体力，做肉类比较好吧～。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_08:1_4_002_08_f:cmd-000042:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ba0f2cff442e6003f0790e3936572e217189f4e6730d850ab54e7ec28ccb1ba4",
      "text": "咲先生、卷绪先生，辛苦了。\n看你们表情挺认真的，在聊些什么呢？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_08:1_4_002_08_f:cmd-000048:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ef952dd4709784fa09c50c3722b3207d4bb87527e2d15369febed7d9e7864ae8",
      "text": "辛苦了，●●●●プロデューサー。\n我们正在商量下一次的慰劳品！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_08:1_4_002_08_f:cmd-000056:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:3231440f5d77deda4b7fd3f3d2238264cdaf95641cd4bf935a24a3365dc7bdf3",
      "text": "马上就要正式演出了，所以想做一份\n满～满注入了加油心意的便当♪",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_08:1_4_002_08_f:cmd-000066:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:4e56f1688caf36d47ff307f6d64d0eec37c02ad67f00fcba0924eda7af339d4b",
      "text": "肯定会消耗很多体力，\n米饭的量再多加一点或许也不错呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_08:1_4_002_08_f:cmd-000075:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7dafcd46dddee6a5f3d43a687e6b2034b53e8608a677b3debb5571940e9f1cb3",
      "text": "对呀，让他们吃得饱饱的！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_08:1_4_002_08_f:cmd-000085:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e4e9cb33f6342069807f8cbf8f8bed680ded94b143e386f082538e6c74478610",
      "text": "话说回来……\n虽然只是猜测，龙是不是不擅长吃鱿鱼呀？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_08:1_4_002_08_f:cmd-000089:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:5808bb4eb355d77f6d6b042fe50993da612366b6cc2492c5e279d3bed72c7bb3",
      "text": "是这样吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_08:1_4_002_08_f:cmd-000104:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:44c0f5e693c2fc8f2935595382f79007ff211dacfabe22844fa8428e60f6cc35",
      "text": "嗯。上次看到炸鱿鱼的时候，\n总觉得他露出了有点为难的表情……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_08:1_4_002_08_f:cmd-000131:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:3009e014725b84e39f9ebf577dd40408bc578388ce991c646eb9f2f8db6dfed5",
      "text": "那就做去掉鱿鱼的菜单吧。\n还有青椒也是，对吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_08:1_4_002_08_f:cmd-000138:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c91c6df68b306611c83c71a7f04f4a7482d623408e875175e988a48268a4c5b3",
      "text": "每次都在变化的慰劳品菜单，原来全凭\n这样的观察力和服务精神才做出来的啊。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_08:1_4_002_08_f:cmd-000146:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:0046aacbb23b25d231c1d7ad13b72a44cbe94a999a84b377a10cec377a6f8078",
      "text": "哎嘿嘿。一想到要让他们\n更～加开心，浑身就有使不完的劲呢♪",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_08:1_4_002_08_g:cmd-000016:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:4dd27a857a4773aefe98073ed4735865091fcbbe909c85a35eb4c95d252a3f74",
      "text": "“力量微笑LIVE”当天……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_08:1_4_002_08_g:cmd-000026:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6274bd97051ad2a203b67b780baaeafde9aa52538210f35437b0d32c36547ffe",
      "text": "座位请往这边走。如果有任何问题，\n请随时告知附近的工作人员！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_08:1_4_002_08_g:cmd-000033:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:9d3ffad27d2ecab303ade39c762303323412e7eeb5dca1442e51827d430cec5e",
      "text": "怎么啦？啊，摔倒受伤了吗！\n没事，和大哥哥一起去休息室吧！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_08:1_4_002_08_g:cmd-000038:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:145f6edd19b13d14f61bc950dda7e67e9f34b22b6d461fb2288c78df026d5861",
      "text": "非常感谢您今天光临现场。\n好的，洗手间在这边。我来为您带路！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_08:1_4_002_08_g:cmd-000048:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:0f6d1e1723e4b0a89d49c956799ff65477639e483045f3cf39c42f0a2f945fae",
      "text": "（偶像和工作人员全都通力合作，\n负责着舞台的接待和引导观众……）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_08:1_4_002_08_g:cmd-000050:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f4cad01419aa4fd8dd4faa102ac0fcd663c0d4f336ba6279be6638a721956a4c",
      "text": "（照这样下去，应该能顺利举办演出了！）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_08:1_4_002_08_g:cmd-000066:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6560c894283b692cf72e00a589433a2c2367f2c51b8ebdee9269d5bff6996a40",
      "text": "●●●●プロデューサー，不好意思。\n你在哪里看到龙了吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_08:1_4_002_08_g:cmd-000068:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:bb95628ca72d48087cfa7c014d532f2eb9485bda13a64d752b75abf721aaa27a",
      "text": "龙先生的话，\n去对面的停车场迎接观众了哦。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_08:1_4_002_08_g:cmd-000076:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:9ac3f2e4dd1c4a1ae3b839f9473e70b555b0a67280786a67bb074e28260b3147",
      "text": "这样啊，有点事要确认，我正在找他。\n电话也打不通。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_08:1_4_002_08_g:cmd-000084:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:fa2ebabe01a5af5a51f9242d2e6ffdf524c05e84f918a8ea019c800ddb7b3ee2",
      "text": "不知道是信号不好，\n还是倒霉遇到了故障……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_08:1_4_002_08_g:cmd-000088:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:095f35c0f0d916aa0ed288ae4d0f94992f05cfb501c070fb1144ca94d434b0b7",
      "text": "确实有可能是\n又卷进了什么倒霉事里。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_08:1_4_002_08_g:cmd-000095:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:52421bd17dcae3185be0cd02f6d0087e9f4fabc2186338669647c923be5c08e9",
      "text": "要不换●●●●プロデューサー试试，\n给他联络一下……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_08:1_4_002_08_g:cmd-000109:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:955fa925aea2272d98a52c72c69f50afad1fcd958813a4689a948c0e1cc641d3",
      "text": "啊，是龙先生打来的！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_08:1_4_002_08_g:cmd-000120:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b709ea6bf3f94a8bd9eabb51a00d7b9eddb951833e3c73de8c4bfdb722160179",
      "text": "●●●●プロデューサー！？太好了，\n刚才手机突然出毛病吓死我了，总算打通了～！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_08:1_4_002_08_g:cmd-000123:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:aee2ae39f36b7abd39fc18feb8858bed92ef5c591a7f502d1b657f8e5ec7304f",
      "text": "这么忙的时候打电话，对不起！其实啊，我到了\n停车场这边，但是看不到客人们的人影。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_08:1_4_002_08_g:cmd-000125:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b729255754c54fa2cb0063089a9311bd38613a82e3ede1d638a1a1bb3fc59553",
      "text": "明明是顺着作为路标的路锥走过来的，真奇怪啊。\n……咦？那边也有路锥。那边也有？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_08:1_4_002_08_g:cmd-000127:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d25cb5adc0340f90b97981381ffc327f63af1f6611144f93ec64997bcf2e9a16",
      "text": "难道说，位置被挪动过了！？\n呜呜。又是我平时的倒霉毛病犯了吗～～！？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_08:1_4_002_08_g:cmd-000129:choice_short:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a212b45a7c854dd46cad38421f2c618e852be6fcc8a30dca95bb4fdc5fc2a832",
      "text": "周围有些什么\n东西吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_08:1_4_002_08_g:cmd-000132:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f8c7e72e4c7d3a1e80b08c1f9446f582db62cd5cc90cc2d1c6d6af3ac7145906",
      "text": "哎？能看到厕所什么的，\n还有一栋红屋顶的建筑物！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_08:1_4_002_08_g:cmd-000134:choice_short:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:9512a02aabe9852d8e86b90755f123ad23a9a1f37f2732c37c74a6622155acd9",
      "text": "请试着往那栋\n红色的建筑物走！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_08:1_4_002_08_g:cmd-000137:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b82846c6a2bb36e1a5718268d6547f83021c0255caec47212533400108e2d855",
      "text": "知道了！……嗯？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_08:1_4_002_08_g:cmd-000139:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7b44fb6437724ca3a01cee9376ef519d87623251d7aff75aa28e18058f39a11f",
      "text": "啊，那群人……是客人们！\n太好了，总算会合了！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_08:1_4_002_08_g:cmd-000141:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:dc1375e05cfbf18c02976e64f9ca89fb1fd740c55a912e610d173b183612c2f6",
      "text": "谢谢你，●●●●プロデューサー。\n我马上带大家往那边走！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_08:1_4_002_08_h:cmd-000024:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:978eaf62788d8333efc263ece7e517eb96d40a32b47c5dc1bee6247e22f53b7f",
      "text": "这里就是大家的座位了。\n因为我的倒霉让大家久等了，对不起啊……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_08:1_4_002_08_h:cmd-000027:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e5c7a67db67aeb009d4e2fdbfeeb9aaa666af0c023432535a4bf6a0b625106b2",
      "text": "没关系的！跑着过来找我们的\n龙君，超级帅气哦！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_08:1_4_002_08_h:cmd-000032:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c4c70a3465873bbf9f2162eefc95ccfcada1a74b43676b8d2093f0513d8bb095",
      "text": "就是说啊。而且，\n能这么近跟龙先生说话太高兴了！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_08:1_4_002_08_h:cmd-000034:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a87dac2673938b3ddf6eedf0ba6f863341d6a22475e3ac18c879824021a4837f",
      "text": "突然听说“力量部门”取消了，\n本来还觉得很遗憾……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_08:1_4_002_08_h:cmd-000037:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:8a7b9dc47811a30a08d2d2755a0af7c7e07beee97b31d13951f53069c1dad8e9",
      "text": "多亏了龙先生，反而变成了幸运的事！\n很期待正式演出，请加油！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_08:1_4_002_08_h:cmd-000049:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:145a44542ecac210e98462f81e15c0fd375b1d36833e39c2fc6f0dd3082b39c6",
      "text": "……我的倒霉，变成了大家的幸运？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_08:1_4_002_08_h:cmd-000068:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:24efb2ede510e23f6eb8641d507d79cec532bd5467a70c7de41b0b0e14a65e87",
      "text": "太好了呢，龙。多亏了你，\n演出开始前大家就已经喜笑颜开了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_08:1_4_002_08_h:cmd-000073:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:381875bc8dee95959d2d621e2467b5ca7c6fe115e2591ba9a8b1fb4a364bb82f",
      "text": "只要有一点契机，\n厄运也能转变为幸运。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_08:1_4_002_08_h:cmd-000080:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d7ce4bd35a690b2c756db77edbd0a99dc522aefa499d1c103e5093b34db981ff",
      "text": "就算有时很难扭转，\n只要大家一起承担，就没问题。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_08:1_4_002_08_h:cmd-000084:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:00a0ebb629d70135af155600883c4b33d674d6be3992ae5e1d00619b4446a266",
      "text": "我们每天在训练中强健体魄，\n就是为了这种时候啊。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_08:1_4_002_08_h:cmd-000092:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:887dbe66764160c341ceeb13a7ab0d6c09a4c8e873e2fe4c748ccad4130947ec",
      "text": "没错，龙。\n所以，别那么沮丧了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_08:1_4_002_08_h:cmd-000098:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:bd4cc90c2e68c688983648695d01356a8d75b5c85104fc5a4b61f80020f15ffb",
      "text": "接下来要用舞台表演，\n让全场都绽放笑容，对吧？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_08:1_4_002_08_h:cmd-000107:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:5513e3cd60e438b366a2ad8d0630817e8f9461fa268cd50d235655d2f5ac170e",
      "text": "英雄先生、诚司先生……好的！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_08:1_4_002_08_i:cmd-000020:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e3f592b7f0f3798aafdd8ead76a3b834cda6c08a1cfb38b55273a1ec2a16d1ca",
      "text": "“力量微笑LIVE”开始……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_08:1_4_002_08_i:cmd-000038:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:0d677f746216d99609e9650834829a3491d7c7e9bcd8a53b2f558d351301727b",
      "text": "感谢大家今天来到\n“力量微笑LIVE”现场！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_08:1_4_002_08_i:cmd-000050:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7b9ade739255139b12a9e768410f18c5fe822250923f4871149238ccc5a3abc4",
      "text": "跟上我们的力量吧！\n然后，展现出你们最棒的笑容！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_08:1_4_002_08_i:cmd-000061:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:fe121938462c3ccf12b75de99f3fecbf9233c87b42b429a80550ad3860e66b03",
      "text": "来吧，嗨起来！\n全场的大家也一起喊出声来吧！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_08:1_4_002_08_i:cmd-000087:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:00f0e92f217f01dba89d0ea4719b7028cb261b452bfd173bc21008220bdd6c26",
      "text": "LIVE结束后……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_08:1_4_002_08_i:cmd-000103:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:aa89160c150346fc4bc879a3e81350f3ea91316435f79a68264ac01751e24e05",
      "text": "LIVE辛苦了！每个组合都是\n充满力量的热烈舞台啊！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_08:1_4_002_08_i:cmd-000109:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2db5545777f47fc2afe5e82f67c1783a9fae432cc623f6fa78109c669f5f7282",
      "text": "多亏了FRAME提议哪怕只办舞台演出也好，\n才有了现在的成果。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_08:1_4_002_08_i:cmd-000120:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:47cb04d65a41863bb05d8aef23e0443b06bd06058cb37dfd56670c0d786f9c19",
      "text": "哈哈，LIVE能成功，\n是因为有大家的力量在，对吧？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_08:1_4_002_08_i:cmd-000128:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b4509ba1ae399ba845344686216ece33c27f79afa23dff33b95da46c15f03a84",
      "text": "不如说，如果不是这批成员，\n恐怕会很难办到呢……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_08:1_4_002_08_i:cmd-000137:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d42d98eacd5a91419c5815098982279532ae39ca5b2025d1176ca1be08f28ba4",
      "text": "是啊，大家的力量和坚韧真让人佩服。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_08:1_4_002_08_i:cmd-000144:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7067f4c383616a9c948b8e00556eedabd809d85d066731b72506f878556d83db",
      "text": "搭建舞台的时候，看着大家，\n我心里好几次冒出了“不能认输！”的念头呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_08:1_4_002_08_i:cmd-000149:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a14c4f8946b08e0ba2d9a759766bdf74f1db40d5bad20a2989b00ab734472366",
      "text": "明明是在演出之后，\n收拾整理也是转眼间就搞定了……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_08:1_4_002_08_i:cmd-000158:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:4bc1f897d4740cbc55c1e9264c990f3a0b77abe68ea47a6bd952f1967a243392",
      "text": "我们这边对FRAME也是这么想的哦！\n你们三个人，身心都太坚韧了！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_08:1_4_002_08_i:cmd-000163:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:bcf0a240cdb3e7ed6e60e48e0a9a97894154f15e5ecaeb87eb0846e128dee682",
      "text": "哎呀，谢谢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_08:1_4_002_08_i:cmd-000168:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:bd73f8ce0ebd9e85ad2f86cece73856b2fcb22292af010d65f604b0623ee428f",
      "text": "感觉，有点不好意思啊……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_08:1_4_002_08_i:cmd-000171:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b8033b6a1126eafdb99f29cb114d218e75bd268309dd29d698758be8d9f7cb09",
      "text": "就是呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_08:1_4_002_08_i:cmd-000186:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b8d5af4d2c328f54c00fb87192a8cf2670318823dbb6a7394539b73ccdcf269b",
      "text": "哈哈哈……！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_08:1_4_002_08_i:cmd-000200:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:de032b14ad770092a08e64ee0b7359b1bdf150548e5d96e8eacb1487cc8ae481",
      "text": "翌日……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_08:1_4_002_08_i:cmd-000207:mobile_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e29224e1791fa4180f1530c448278ea1ff66f7202fd77ace16fd7d0672c231f5",
      "text": "英雄先生，\n迟迟没有过来呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_08:1_4_002_08_i:cmd-000209:mobile_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f201dcf1837804acc615e2019a601b7e4e2ab5a4cdb0405c238a2b2b9cf5102a",
      "text": "虽然距离回去的大巴发车\n还有时间",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_08:1_4_002_08_i:cmd-000211:mobile_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:0f3c80cc61554018e20fde978f1fa70ae9624ef8a16d05df72036747c138976a",
      "text": "英雄，你现在在哪里？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_08:1_4_002_08_i:cmd-000213:mobile_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6cf4345820bf30f518693523cfa07d4bcd74ae32ef7394dbba159dc7f1de6abd",
      "text": "在酒店的走廊。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_08:1_4_002_08_i:cmd-000215:mobile_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:77dbba3bd4f57da6c2cfd572058f1835e8e5d69630cf8d1e478910dc0d1db918",
      "text": "肌肉酸痛得动作比平时\n慢了3倍啊。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_08:1_4_002_08_i:cmd-000217:mobile_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7f700e20a5c41984b1ea33a616423882a04314dddb359fec362a7d565f13ca58",
      "text": "马上就到大巴了\n等我一下。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_08:1_4_002_08_i:cmd-000219:choice_short:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:628b01ab78ba45bed1d98de1bed34a8d0af64929385fda65e0de17eae9c4ecc9",
      "text": "要去接您吗",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_08:1_4_002_08_i:cmd-000219:choice_detail:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:233ae98cde4954a8c75b665ff8c50450faf79ddbe7f41d6177e1afa9fe849d59",
      "text": "要去接您吗。\n在几楼的走廊呢？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_08:1_4_002_08_i:cmd-000220:choice_short:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:fdd0681426b89d55a5500d272d6a4bff3c7a46548c99c3d5b550611557f7b343",
      "text": "有那么严重吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_08:1_4_002_08_i:cmd-000220:choice_detail:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:8e41a70f0b6da6b44cf584edef5dcb8be5fe91a2ff1274ea1ea0d40506dca781",
      "text": "有那么严重吗？\n直到收拾完之前\n看着都还挺好的。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_08:1_4_002_08_i:cmd-000224:mobile_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:9f1d8b1cb516c73b4aa3b867ff00ccd87533868f25e67efcfe63f4e879b53056",
      "text": "没想到居然严重到\n动弹不得的地步啊。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_08:1_4_002_08_i:cmd-000226:mobile_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ce18308c8d6850ae38adbeb65b3f197514c86a6674fd09c5b7a9be7d16d06eea",
      "text": "制作人\n在车里等着就好。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_08:1_4_002_08_i:cmd-000228:mobile_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:893f5fc2dd3af737eaa49f879eee533dc3ea7428632271775970935aef38d4f8",
      "text": "我们去把英雄先生\n接回来！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_08:1_4_002_08_i:cmd-000230:mobile_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a3feceda89828aa25433e58b120e190325e0f10e3523edc3f65f6dfa5d36b47b",
      "text": "现在去回收你。\n英雄你在那里\n待命吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_08:1_4_002_08_j:cmd-000014:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:25ce8fff22bba1a368b360668d9407a0e4cfa4360b66c9d5fd5344de03950bd0",
      "text": "……可恶，搞什么“力量微笑LIVE”！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_08:1_4_002_08_j:cmd-000021:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:8d6b329bb43d212620b005d0aa66f2898f4083c54ef26f95dd59f97b1cc2beac",
      "text": "（我虽然说过别什么都问我、由现场定夺，\n但可没说连那种事都能自作主张啊！）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_08:1_4_002_08_j:cmd-000029:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2b251efcc49e9bcead8ebb58fdb1b6322a8c034558800722d769e5a228d90658",
      "text": "……男极联赛本来就是为了让大家明白\n我的事务所才是第一，才特意举办的。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_08:1_4_002_08_j:cmd-000041:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:4fdecb5cd367b73d01431e303e93a759e60d177a24c9e1d8c203510495700b6e",
      "text": "运动会给竞争对手们发了错误的规则……\n之后也持续进行各种各样的妨碍……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_08:1_4_002_08_j:cmd-000049:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d5936ac6e876d082f978c01505a3593df9320b344fdeb0f902278fa5e5e239d0",
      "text": "最近更是无视工作人员打乱现场节奏……！\n这次明明都逼得他们取消舞台了……！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_08:1_4_002_08_j:cmd-000059:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:0ad1b3d189eb02a55c117029aa569ff45b3abdf3ceb022f947714e9f8207e41b",
      "text": "那个不知哪来的事务所每次都擅自行动，\n搞得声势浩大！我的盘算全落空了！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_08:1_4_002_08_j:cmd-000066:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d91a95aa22e0583b943312a11eef8830231a03708522fd65d5824f17738ba20e",
      "text": "（哼！果然这种大会还是趁早\n切割、撤退才是上策……）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_08:1_4_002_08_j:cmd-000087:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7ed4b2e228eb2ae97beffef248310db309351015bf7d51d3b1af62e572ef4dba",
      "text": "虽然男极联赛已临近尾声……\n但各位都太优秀了，实在是选不出KING！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_08:1_4_002_08_j:cmd-000089:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f5ddcd96246b64f1fda570264310e4a804ea0e4d6c41eced917b0de728b547b1",
      "text": "因此，这样如何？给至今为止表现尤为突出的\n前5名事务所，颁发优秀奖。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_08:1_4_002_08_j:cmd-000091:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:9162894e4d4a6b91188b9c71d6534c2e2c8410b01b2272ca88ad9a725423719d",
      "text": "这样一来，就能让超出预期的更多偶像、事务所，\n以及粉丝们都皆大欢喜了！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_08:1_4_002_08_j:cmd-000098:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d8b8d9ca26f1fce76a55501fe18c8eaa2585880eb8eaa6aab5ac168c13859788",
      "text": "（呵呵呵……这样的话，\n就绝不会有我们以外的人拿到KING了！）",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
